{"id":"4519dfdd6e3aa4d9","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-kappa-saturated.md","title":"Kappa-Saturated","display":"df-kappa-saturated — Kappa-Saturated","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-kappa-saturated","aliases":["58-df-kappa-saturated","Kappa-Saturated"],"display":"df-kappa-saturated — Kappa-Saturated","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-type.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-logic.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-omega1.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-kappa-saturated"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-kappa-saturated</span><span>Kappa-Saturated</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kappa-saturated — Kappa-Saturated"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8dfa3853919882a\" href=\"?note=c8dfa3853919882a\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-type.md\">../batch10/58-df-type.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-logic.md\">../batch17/58-df-logic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"27ae6ad867a7007d\" href=\"?note=27ae6ad867a7007d\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md\">../batch17/58-df-omega1.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\kappa,A,p,a\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\kappa,A,p,a\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\)</span>（结构谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\)</span>（分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span>（基数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Th}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Th}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal M)\\)</span>（此处定义的完备句子理论）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S(p,A,\\operatorname{Th}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal M),\\Sigma,1)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S(p,A,\\operatorname{Th}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal M),\\Sigma,1)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S(\\mathcal M,\\langle a\\rangle,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S(\\mathcal M,\\langle a\\rangle,p)\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c8dfa3853919882a\" href=\"?note=c8dfa3853919882a\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-type.md\">../batch10/58-df-type.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SaturatedInLanguage}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{SaturatedInLanguage}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Saturated}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Saturated}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（规范谓词与兼容别名）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CountablySaturated}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\operatorname{CountablySaturated}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>（此处采用“对可数参数集饱和”的约定）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory\\text{-}of\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\operatorname{Th}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal M)\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma):\\forall s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\mathcal M\\models\\sigma[s])\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory\\text{-}of\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\operatorname{Th}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal M)\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma):\\forall s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\mathcal M\\models\\sigma[s])\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}saturated} \\vdash \\mathrm{SaturatedInLanguage}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\\Bigl(|A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\forall p\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S(p,A,\\operatorname{Th}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal M),\\Sigma,1)\\to\\exists a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S(\\mathcal M,\\langle a\\rangle,p)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}saturated} \\vdash \\mathrm{SaturatedInLanguage}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\\Bigl(|A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\forall p\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S(p,A,\\operatorname{Th}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal M),\\Sigma,1)\\to\\exists a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S(\\mathcal M,\\langle a\\rangle,p)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}saturated\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{Saturated}_S(\\mathcal M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Sigma\\;\\mathrm{SaturatedInLanguage}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}saturated\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{Saturated}_S(\\mathcal M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Sigma\\;\\mathrm{SaturatedInLanguage}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}countably\\text{-}saturated} \\vdash \\operatorname{CountablySaturated}_S(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Saturated}_S(\\mathcal M,\\omega_1)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}countably\\text{-}saturated} \\vdash \\operatorname{CountablySaturated}_S(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Saturated}_S(\\mathcal M,\\omega_1)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-饱和实现所有少于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 个参数上的完备类型；对无限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>，一元类型表述等价于有限元组表述。</li>\n<li>本文件约定“countably saturated”表示对可数参数集饱和，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_1\">\\(\\aleph_1\\)</span>-饱和；有些文献把它用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span>-饱和，使用时需说明。</li>\n<li>Monster model 通常选取某个远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|T|\">\\(|T|\\)</span> 的基数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>，并要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-饱和且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-强齐性；不是“只对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa&lt;|\\mathcal L|\">\\(\\kappa&lt;|\\mathcal L|\\)</span>”。</li>\n<li>给定理论在足够大基数上有饱和模型需要相应的基数与稳定性条件；不能无条件断言存在可数饱和模型。</li>\n<li>上游 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"8294484f800fb9a1\" href=\"?note=8294484f800fb9a1\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-saturated.md\">../batch03/58-df-saturated.md</a> 反向依赖本文件，故这里移除对它的依赖以打断循环。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Marker, Model Theory: An Introduction</li>\n<li>Shelah, Classification Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"c8dfa3853919882a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-type.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../